---
import Prose from '../../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { site } from '../../../site.config';
import { aboutListings, buyerAdvice, classifiedTerm, marketplaceLine } from '../../lib/copy';
const e = site.entity;
---
<Prose title={`About ${site.name}`} description={`Who runs ${site.name}, how land listings and ${e.one} profiles work, and how we make money.`} path="/about/" h1={`About ${site.name}`} lead={`${site.name} is an online marketplace for rural land: farms, ranches, timberland, hunting properties and acreage, listed by owners and land professionals.`}>
  <h2>What we are, and what we are not</h2>
  <p>{marketplaceLine} We do not negotiate, hold deposits, handle closings or take a commission. Buyers and sellers deal with each other directly.</p>
  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>Sellers pay {classifiedTerm} per land listing. Land agents can pay for a Verified profile. Buyers pay nothing. Nobody can pay to change what a listing says or to rank higher than other land listings, which are shown newest first by default.</p>
  <h2 id="land">Land listings</h2>
  <p>Each listing is written by the seller and reviewed by us before it goes live. Acreage, price and features are what the seller tells us; we do not inspect land or check title, boundaries, access, zoning, utilities, flood status, mineral rights or taxes. {buyerAdvice}</p>
  <h2 id="listings">Land agent profiles</h2>
  <p>Profiles come from public sources (the agent’s own website and public pages) or from the agent. Every profile shows its source and when it was last updated. We do not publish ratings or reviews.</p>
  {aboutListings.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
  <p><a href="/listing-plans/">Agent profiles and pricing</a> · <a href="/contact/">Contact</a></p>
</Prose>
